        "nobel_worthiness": "HPV virus-like-particle vaccines provide an exceptionally clear preventive intervention against infection and several cancers, with major worldwide public-health impact.",
        "attribution": "The proposed three laureates represent the central conceptual and experimental development of the VLP vaccine approach.",
        "maturity": "The biological principle, clinical efficacy, and population-level implementation are all long established.",
