      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Adult stem-cell-derived organoids made it possible to model normal tissue, disease, and treatment response in experimentally tractable human-relevant systems.",
        "attribution": "Clevers and Sato provide a compact and coherent attribution for the key intestinal adult-stem-cell organoid advance.",
        "maturity": "The platform has been replicated, diversified across tissues, and integrated into basic and translational research.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Organoid development includes major antecedents and parallel advances in stem-cell culture.",
          "The degree to which organoids reproduce whole-organ physiology varies by model."
        ]
      }
    },
