        "attribution": "Benabid is strongly and directly associated with the defining therapeutic innovation.",
        "maturity": "Its benefit, limitations, and clinical place have been established through decades of use.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The mechanism of therapeutic stimulation remains incompletely resolved.",
          "Important contributions to target selection, surgical technique, device development, and clinical validation extend beyond a single investigator."
        ]
      }
